1
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,240
Please let Wu Huilan find stability soon,

2
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,800
so I can go back to Shanghai.

3
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:52,480
I can't backpay a three-month gap in my social security.

4
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,120
Bodhisattva, bless me.

5
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,640
Gods of all directions, protect my well-being.

6
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,600
With palms joined in pure devotion.

7
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,360
Please bless me, Chen Xiaofang,

8
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,440
to become a multimillionaire soon.

9
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,920
Thank you, Buddha.

10
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:23,720
Done wishing?

11
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,360
You asked for so much,

12
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,960
even Buddha won't be able to hear it all.

13
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,320
Don't say things like that in front of Buddha.

14
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,040
I meant no disrespect. I meant no disrespect.

15
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,160
Sincerity brings blessings.

16
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,240
Don't you know?

17
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,960
Half is up to man, half to heaven.

18
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:42,240
Man proposes, Heaven disposes.

19
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,840
You don't even know this?

20
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,840
All I know is,

21
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,960
you're sounding more and more like Uncle Chen.

22
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,000
Let's go, let's go.

23
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,800
What's this?

24
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,120
I got a protection amulet for you.

25
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,760
To keep you safe.

26
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,600
I'll hang it up then.

27
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,640
Want some candy?

28
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,040
It's so sweet.

29
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:42,800
This month,

30
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,480
after all the expenses,

31
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,840
we're actually operating at a loss.

32
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,160
Looks like this business

33
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:51,240
is gonna go under on my watch.

34
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,000
Dad,

35
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,480
didn't you always tell us growing up

36
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,880
to respect this trade

37
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:59,520
and not be obsessed with money?

38
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,320
People need to be flexible.

39
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,800
Anyway, you make all the rules.

40
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,880
You brat! Is that how you talk to your old man?

41
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,920
Do you think burning all this stuff

42
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,240
means his great-uncle

43
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,680
can actually use it down there?

44
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,320
What do you know?

45
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,000
Throughout history,

46
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,920
if Emperor Qin Shi Huang could build a mausoleum,

47
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:28,000
then we ordinary folks are allowed

48
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,440
to burn paper servants and horses,

49
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:32,200
washing machines, TVs, hot pots and stuff.

50
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:36,400
Every family just hopes their departed loved ones

51
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:39,280
can live a good life down there too.

52
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,080
Bro.

53
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:00,640
We've got customers.

54
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,280
Hello.

55
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,760
Hello. Please, have a seat inside.

56
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,320
Our shop offers a wide range of services.

57
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,880
From hospice care and funeral services,

58
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:12,920
to selecting burial plots and arranging memorial halls.

59
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,800
We have everything you need.

60
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,040
Please, have a seat.

61
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,080
I was wondering what brings you two here today,

62
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,240
and what you'd like to consult us about.

63
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,160
We'd like to book a funeral

64
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,560
and buy a double burial plot.

65
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:25,880
Here, have some water first.

66
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:26,800
Thank you.

67
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,360
If you're arranging a funeral for an elder,

68
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,880
then we definitely need to plan it carefully.

69
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,760
Let me introduce our options to you.

70
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,040
The funerals at our shop

71
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,240
come in a variety of styles.

72
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:37,200
They can be simple, but never plain.

73
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,120
If you want it luxurious and grand,

74
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,120
we have packages for that too.

75
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,200
Anyway, our ultimate goal is

76
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,360
to let the elders depart in peace

77
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,360
and give the younger generation peace of mind.

78
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:42,960
Right?

79
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,280
We're not...

80
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,520
And about that double burial plot,

81
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,680
our shop offers custom double plots.

82
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,640
Great location and excellent feng shui.

83
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,200
Um, we...

84
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:53,360
Behind it is a dense pine forest.

85
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,120
Do you know what a pine forest represents?

86
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,320
It represents longevity and good fortune.

87
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,920
When the deceased are buried here,

88
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,960
they receive eternal peace and blessing.

89
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,720
If you book it now,

90
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,280
I can give you a discount.

91
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:05,960
Twenty percent off.

92
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,240
After the discount, it's 39,800.

93
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:12,840
Please, take a look.

94
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,080
Um...

95
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:20,640
We're not booking a funeral for an elder.

96
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,440
We are booking it

97
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,840
for ourselves.

98
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,040
Booking a funeral.

99
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,920
For... for yourselves?

100
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,200
Arranging a funeral?

101
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,680
We are sick.

102
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,760
We probably don't have much time left.

103
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,160
We want to be buried together.

104
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:52,120
But our budget is limited.

105
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,000
We only have about...

106
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,040
5,000 yuan.

107
00:06:57,800 --> 00:07:00,280
What do you mean you don't have much time left?

108
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,080
You're both so young,

109
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,280
and perfectly fine.

110
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:05,320
Why are you always thinking about dying?

111
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,760
Even following some trend

112
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,840
to pre-book a funeral.

113
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,880
Just leave.

114
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,200
We can't take this job.

115
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:18,840
No, wait...

116
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,800
We're sorry.

117
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,360
Sorry.

118
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,080
Sorry for bothering you.

119
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:22,720
We're sorry.

120
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,360
Sorry.

121
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,960
Dad, come on!

122
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:26,960
If you don't want the job, fine.

123
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,120
But you can't just kick people out!

124
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,360
What is wrong with you?

125
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,960
Please wait!

126
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,480
When that construction worker fell last time,

127
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,960
the pay was low and nobody took the job,

128
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:43,960
but you took it.

129
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,720
I thought you were different from them.

130
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,240
Guess I was wrong.

131
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,880
No matter how much it costs,

132
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,960
you should still go see a doctor.

133
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,480
As long as there's a little bit of hope,

134
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,960
you still have to try.

135
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,640
The road to the underworld knows no age.

136
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,800
Families are torn apart at the Naihe Bridge.

137
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,960
You're just too young.

138
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:13,360
Don't wait until old age to seek the way.

139
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,960
Lonely graves often belong to the young.

140
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,680
As long as you're alive,

141
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,680
there will be hope.

142
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,560
I'm really sorry.

143
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,600
My dad... he can be a bit too blunt.

144
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,920
Please don't take it to heart.

145
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,880
Here is my business card.

146
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,960
If there's anything I can help with,

147
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,080
please be sure to contact me.

148
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,560
It's okay.

149
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,920
We don't have much money.

150
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,920
We asked many places, but no one took the job.

151
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:36,000
My dad probably didn't mean it like that...

152
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,320
Um...

153
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,200
I made these myself.

154
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,480
Here, for you.

155
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:42,680
It's so pretty.

156
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,200
I'll take one, then.

157
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:46,400
Thank you.

158
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,240
Miss Chen,

159
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:50,640
we'll be setting up a stall at Huimin Square tonight.

160
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,640
If you'd like,

161
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,640
you can come hang out with us.

162
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,240
Sure, I'll definitely come by.

163
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,080
We won't bother you any longer, then.

164
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,280
Bye-bye.

165
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,800
Honey, I was wrong.

166
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:15,880
We're in a cooling-off period.

167
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,080
So please, calm down.

168
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,480
And besides,

169
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,720
in front of our shop,

170
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,760
you can't just drop to your knees.

171
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,200
Stand up right now.

172
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,240
Then... can I give you these flowers?

173
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,280
They're red.

174
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,160
Well... then...

175
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,520
What did those two want with you?

176
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,440
Why?

177
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,160
Do you know them?

178
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,840
They came looking for me at Xidongdong.

179
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,000
Said they wanted to plan a wedding.

180
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,280
But their budget was only 2,000.

181
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,560
That 2,000...

182
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,800
isn't even enough for a makeup artist.

183
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,800
Right.

184
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,320
Our Young Master Zhou

185
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,240
would never bother with that kind of money.

186
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,880
After all, your rich daddy

187
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,720
hands out a million in one go.

188
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,200
Who could ever compare to you?

189
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,800
If they're your friends,

190
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,880
I can plan it for free.

191
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,880
You think you're the only one with money, huh?

192
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,520
Honey...

193
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:04,120
Did I say something wrong again?

194
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,640
They just released an awesome new escape room theme.

195
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,440
I heard the plot is a total mind-bender.

196
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,760
Are the NPCs any good?

197
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,720
Oh, absolutely.

198
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,360
The new NPC playing the ghost

199
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,520
is scarier than a real one.

200
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:16,920
Let's go.

201
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,560
But I don't think my heart can take it.

202
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:26,640
You two, look!

203
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,760
A fake fox spirit.

204
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,160
Scared the hell out of you bastards!

205
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,120
Scared the hell out of you!

206
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,720
Scared the crap out of me.

207
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,640
What are you doing here?

208
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,000
Stop eating, Wu Huilan.

209
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,920
You dropped it on the floor.

210
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,240
What's the big deal?

211
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,360
The Earth God wanted a bite.

212
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,520
So I let him have one.

213
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,800
We're working.

214
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,240
Stop eating the props.

215
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,840
Stop slandering me.

216
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,440
I bought this chicken leg myself.

217
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,920
It was buy one, get one free last night.

218
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,400
Got it?

219
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,640
It's so damn good.

220
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:28,840
Be a bit more serious.

221
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,240
You don't want to get fired again.

222
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,840
Why would you jinx me?

223
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,160
I'm doing a great job.

224
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,960
You didn't see my acting just now.

225
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,840
The moment I came out and smiled,

226
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,200
I scared them all away.

227
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:41,920
Oh, right.

228
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,360
Come take a picture of me.

229
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,640
I look so pretty today.

230
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,320
Take a picture of me.

231
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:47,960
Phone.

232
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,000
What's with the attitude?

233
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,840
Oh man, playing a fox spirit is exhausting.

234
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,520
Once I finish eating,

235
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,560
my magic powers will be restored.

236
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,640
Keep saying my ghost act isn't scary,

237
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:11,560
and I'll scare you to death.

238
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:22,600
There does seem to be a weird smell.

239
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,680
Yeah.

240
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,360
I'm really grateful for the company's recognition.

241
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:37,320
But you're asking me

242
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,480
when I can return to Shanghai.

243
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,960
I'm really not sure about that.

244
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:46,280
Something came up at home.

245
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,720
I can't get away right now.

246
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,920
I know this is a rare opportunity.

247
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,200
But...

248
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,880
I really can't go back these next few days.

249
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,120
Okay.

250
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,120
Okay, sure.

251
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,320
Thank you then.

252
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,360
Thanks for understanding.

253
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:01,920
Okay.

254
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,720
Bye.

255
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,120
Boss Jiang.

256
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,960
I made you some hotpot base.

257
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:19,800
Could you

258
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,520
give me a two-year salary advance?

259
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:22,360
I really need it.

260
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:26,680
No.

261
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,200
Two years...

262
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,680
That's too much.

263
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:30,760
Boss Jiang,

264
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,760
here's the hotpot base I made for you.

265
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,560
Could you please give me

266
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,160
a six-month salary advance?

267
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,040
I know I'm being shameless,

268
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,120
and I'm really sorry.

269
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:42,960
Boss Jiang.

270
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,320
Our family has recently

271
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,840
run into some trouble.

272
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:49,520
Could you please

273
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:51,320
give me an advance on my salary?

274
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:53,720
I made you some hotpot base.

275
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,200
If you want some,

276
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,560
I can make it for you every day.

277
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:57,920
I can't cry. I can't cry.

278
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:58,640
So frustrating.

279
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,160
What should I do?

280
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,640
Shady business! Serial plagiarists!

281
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:08,760
Stealing people's business!

282
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:10,760
Ruining the industry's reputation!

283
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:17,680
Shady business! Plagiarists!

284
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:22,240
Shady business! Plagiarists!

285
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,360
Boss Zhao.

286
