575
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:17,360
I've got muscles too, you know.

576
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:21,760
Come on, let's drink, drink, drink!

577
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:22,920
Who'd win an arm-wrestling match?

578
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,720
Really.

579
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,560
Today, this... this...

580
00:26:28,560 --> 00:26:30,360
this script of yours is really well written.

581
00:26:30,360 --> 00:26:31,080
Is that right?

582
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,680
That's how I make my living, you know.

583
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,480
As long as you're satisfied, Mr. Jiang.

584
00:26:33,840 --> 00:26:34,640
Great, great, great.

585
00:26:35,080 --> 00:26:35,960
Let's drink then. Come on, drink up.

586
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:36,680
Still drinking?

587
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:40,400
Let's have another.

588
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:42,680
Sure, sure.

589
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:43,160
So happy!

590
00:26:43,760 --> 00:26:44,240
Come on.

591
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:48,600
Another one.

592
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:50,680
Okay, okay.

593
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:51,440
Come.

594
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:55,360
Something's fishy here.

595
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:56,840
You old geezer.

596
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:59,320
Don't tell me you're trying to rob the cradle

597
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:01,120
and have your eyes on our Yiran.

598
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:02,720
I'll kick your ass, you son of a...

599
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,320
Count me in.

600
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,240
It is a bit weird.

601
00:27:18,280 --> 00:27:20,920
I did such a great job today,

602
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:23,520
but you haven't even had a single drink with me.

603
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,040
Well, yeah.

604
00:27:25,040 --> 00:27:25,920
Come, give me the glass, Daren.

605
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:30,640
One glass for love, two for affection,

606
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:32,680
and three for good luck!

607
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,680
Let's down one first.

608
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:38,600
Fill it up.

609
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:40,080
Two more glasses to go.

610
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,160
This fast?

611
00:27:41,280 --> 00:27:42,360
Not fast at all.

612
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:43,360
Come on.

613
00:27:43,360 --> 00:27:43,880
Alright, come on.

614
00:27:48,520 --> 00:27:49,120
Alright, alright.

615
00:27:49,120 --> 00:27:49,640
Don't you...

616
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,480
Go easy on the drinks.

617
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:51,760
Come on, fill it up.

618
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:54,640
I can't drink anymore.

619
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:56,800
Hurry up and drink.

620
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:04,080
Mr. Jiang.

621
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:04,760
This...

622
00:28:17,800 --> 00:28:19,440
I'm fine.

623
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,640
My sweetie.

624
00:28:27,280 --> 00:28:28,920
So sweet.

625
00:28:31,800 --> 00:28:32,600
Tell me,

626
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,640
doesn't our Yiran

627
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:37,200
deserve the world's

628
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:39,440
best man and best job?

629
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:40,200
She does.

630
00:28:42,840 --> 00:28:43,640
Wu Huilan,

631
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,120
you're a lightweight who loves to drink.

632
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,840
What did you write in that promise again?

633
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:49,160
What I promised you,

634
00:28:49,520 --> 00:28:51,200
I will absolutely do.

635
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,360
Today I only drank...

636
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,240
Uncle Daren...

637
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:06,080
I couldn't help it.

638
00:29:13,120 --> 00:29:13,920
Yiran.

639
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:15,960
Yiran.

640
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:18,200
Yiran.

641
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,760
Yiran! Quick, quick, quick!

642
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:22,480
Let me look at you.

643
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:23,600
Are you okay?

644
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:24,480
What's wrong?

645
00:29:25,840 --> 00:29:27,440
Jiang Hu didn't do anything to you, did he?

646
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:30,080
Are you okay?

647
00:29:30,280 --> 00:29:31,320
What are you talking about?

648
00:29:32,360 --> 00:29:33,840
I blacked out last night.

649
00:29:33,840 --> 00:29:34,840
I can't remember.

650
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,840
Jiang Hu didn't come to our house, did he?

651
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:39,080
Why would he come to our house?

652
00:29:39,560 --> 00:29:40,520
For charity?

653
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,680
Don't you black out every day?

654
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:44,160
What's the big deal?

655
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:46,760
I was just off my game yesterday.

656
00:29:47,760 --> 00:29:49,240
As long as you're okay, I'm relieved.

657
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:58,880
Lao Li,

658
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:02,720
I blacked out again last night.

659
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:04,840
Something terrible almost happened.

660
00:30:07,560 --> 00:30:09,720
You must protect our Yiran

661
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,600
and help her find someone reliable.

662
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:13,360
Someone who treats her well.

663
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:15,280
Make sure she doesn't meet a scumbag.

664
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,320
Right?

665
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:17,160
Wu Huilan.

666
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:19,920
Stop acting so weird.

667
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:20,880
What are you doing?

668
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:22,560
Are you going to work or what?

669
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,280
Work, work, work.

670
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,360
What time is it?

671
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:28,640
Oh my god.

672
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:29,920
I'm gonna be late! I'm gonna be late!

673
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:43,720
Jiang.

674
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:46,280
Huilan.

675
00:30:46,480 --> 00:30:47,480
What a coincidence.

676
00:30:53,040 --> 00:30:54,000
Coincidence, my ass.

677
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,120
You old dog.

678
00:30:55,120 --> 00:30:56,560
I knew you were up to no good.

679
00:30:56,560 --> 00:30:58,280
If you go after our Yiran again,

680
00:30:58,280 --> 00:30:59,240
I'll...

681
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,360
Young Jiang.

682
00:31:05,080 --> 00:31:06,160
Let me give you a ride!

683
00:31:11,520 --> 00:31:12,600
No need, no need.

684
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:15,320
We can just take the bus.

685
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:15,920
It's on my way.

686
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:16,960
Come on, I'll drop you off.

687
00:31:24,280 --> 00:31:25,760
With only one passenger seat, who's he giving a ride to?

688
00:31:25,760 --> 00:31:27,160
Exactly. The door won't even open.

689
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:31,720
Look.

690
00:31:32,280 --> 00:31:33,760
The bus is right here.

691
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:34,880
What a coincidence.

692
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,880
Like it came just for us.

693
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:37,840
We're leaving.

694
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:38,600
Thanks.

695
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:39,960
Bye, Jiang.

696
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,320
He wants to be Wu Huilan's son-in-law?

697
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:43,280
It won't be that easy.

698
00:31:43,760 --> 00:31:44,600
Swipe card.

699
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:47,640
Wu Huilan, what's gotten into you?

700
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:48,920
Nothing's gotten into me.

701
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:49,880
I have eyes like a hawk.

702
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,480
I can see what kind of monster he is at a glance.

703
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:52,320
Move inside.

704
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:55,640
Things that come too easily,

705
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:57,000
no one will cherish.

706
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:57,800
Got it?

707
00:31:58,800 --> 00:31:59,920
What are you muttering about?

708
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:16,680
Yiran.

709
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:18,280
Yiran!

710
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,200
Let me ask you something.

711
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,200
Go ahead.

712
00:32:30,760 --> 00:32:32,720
Have you thought about getting a boyfriend recently?

713
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,840
Have some fun, you know?

714
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:46,960
No, I haven't.

715
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:47,760
Why?

716
00:32:48,520 --> 00:32:50,400
Eager to marry me off to make room for yourself?

717
00:32:52,760 --> 00:32:53,840
With that mouth of yours,

718
00:32:53,840 --> 00:32:55,160
who would dare marry you?

719
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:57,560
Well, look who I inherited it from.

720
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:59,840
Mom just wants to tell you,

721
00:33:00,840 --> 00:33:02,440
when it comes to finding a man,

722
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:04,440
you need to keep your eyes wide open.

723
00:33:05,320 --> 00:33:06,800
Most men

724
00:33:08,200 --> 00:33:10,520
are like the devil himself,

725
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:11,760
full of nothing but lies.

726
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:14,520
Many of my former cellmates

727
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:16,520
were tricked by men,

728
00:33:16,520 --> 00:33:17,680
and that's why they did stupid things.

729
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,160
Alright, alright.

730
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:21,000
I've heard it a million times.

731
00:33:21,320 --> 00:33:22,200
Wu Huilan,

732
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,200
you should be a matchmaker.

733
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:24,320
You'd be perfect for it.

734
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,640
You're still young.

735
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,800
I'm just afraid you'll get taken advantage of.

736
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,880
Especially by those older men.

737
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,720
They're all cradle-robbers.

738
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:32,680
Even eighty-year-olds

739
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:34,200
want to find an eighteen-year-old.

740
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:37,200
I think that...

741
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,160
Chen Baixi is pretty good.

742
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,560
He's honest,

743
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:40,800
and a 200,000 debt,

744
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:42,160
he took it on without hesitation.

745
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,560
He's a responsible guy.

746
00:33:43,560 --> 00:33:43,920
He's dependable.

747
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,200
There's no way between us.

748
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:48,000
He has a rich, pretty girl chasing after him.

749
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:49,960
Stop playing matchmaker.

750
00:33:50,920 --> 00:33:51,880
Is that so?

751
00:33:53,160 --> 00:33:54,800
Is Mr. Chen that popular?

752
00:33:55,280 --> 00:33:56,600
Looks like I'll have to step in myself,

753
00:33:56,600 --> 00:33:58,760
and make him Wu Huilan's son-in-law.

754
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:00,960
Step in how?

755
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,200
Don't do anything crazy.

756
00:34:05,520 --> 00:34:06,960
You're so nervous.

757
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:07,880
What's the big deal?

758
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,160
You really do like him.

759
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:13,600
Are you blushing?

760
00:34:15,080 --> 00:34:17,120
You definitely like him, you hear me?

761
00:34:17,120 --> 00:34:18,160
I can hear you!

762
00:34:19,200 --> 00:34:20,760
The NPC inside is a murderer.

763
00:34:20,760 --> 00:34:22,120
No way, I really wanted to go.

764
00:34:22,560 --> 00:34:24,800
I've been there. It's the one dressed as a fox spirit.

765
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,840
Crooked business!

766
00:34:25,840 --> 00:34:27,160
She killed someone and went to prison.

767
00:34:27,160 --> 00:34:28,360
That's too scary.

768
00:34:37,240 --> 00:34:38,240
Boss Jiang.

769
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,280
I saw all the comments online.

770
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:47,920
I take responsibility for my own actions.

771
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:49,120
I don't want to drag you down.

772
00:34:49,520 --> 00:34:50,200
I...

773
00:34:50,200 --> 00:34:51,120
I resign.

774
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,000
Huilan.

775
00:34:52,520 --> 00:34:53,320
It's okay.

776
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,720
You really don't need to care about that.

777
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:57,040
You've already helped me a lot.

778
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,720
But my past...

779
00:34:58,720 --> 00:34:59,840
I can't change it.

780
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:02,240
And I can't control the comments online.

781
00:35:02,920 --> 00:35:03,960
Huilan, actually I think...

782
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,320
Don't try to talk me out of it.

783
00:35:05,560 --> 00:35:06,960
I just got here today anyway,

784
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:08,360
and I haven't done anything.

785
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,600
I won't ask for today's pay.

786
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:11,840
Thank you for looking after me.

787
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:16,760
Wu Huilan, why on earth did you quit?

788
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:18,320
We pulled strings to get you this job!

789
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:19,120
Do you know that?

790
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:20,680
The fortune teller said

791
00:35:20,680 --> 00:35:22,200
this job isn't suitable for me.

792
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:23,360
The fortune teller also said you have no brain!

793
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:24,080
And you believed it?

794
00:35:24,080 --> 00:35:25,040
Are you dumb?

795
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:26,000
Tell me.

796
00:35:26,520 --> 00:35:27,880
Did Jiang Hu fire you?

797
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:29,200
And gave you this much severance pay?

798
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:31,280
I'm so damn good at my job,

799
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,800
how could I possibly get fired?

800
00:35:33,720 --> 00:35:34,960
I just didn't want to work there anymore.

801
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:36,440
Look at you getting all cocky.

802
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:38,080
"Didn't want to work there," my foot.

803
00:35:38,680 --> 00:35:40,560
No, I'm calling them to find out.

804
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,560
What are you doing? What are you doing?!

805
00:35:42,560 --> 00:35:43,520
Why do you need to call them?

806
00:35:43,720 --> 00:35:44,800
There are 365 trades in this world,

807
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:45,880
and every trade has its master.

808
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:46,680
You said it yourself!

809
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:48,720
"Don't hang yourself on just one tree."

810
00:35:48,720 --> 00:35:50,920
The problem is you have no other trees to hang from!

811
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:51,920
What are you gonna do?

812
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:52,800
Cry at funerals again?

813
00:35:52,800 --> 00:35:53,760
Or haul pork for people?

814
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,480
You only named a few!

815
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,360
Out of 365 trades,

816
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:58,200
if you subtract those, there are still plenty left!

817
00:35:58,200 --> 00:35:59,320
You just look down on me.

818
00:36:01,120 --> 00:36:02,360
Alright, stop changing the subject.

819
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,120
Tell me the truth.

820
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:03,880
Why exactly did you quit?

821
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:03,920
What's the real reason?

822
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:07,160
I won't ask for today's pay.

823
00:36:07,160 --> 00:36:08,400
Thank you for looking after me.

824
00:36:10,200 --> 00:36:11,160
Huilan.

825
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,120
I like you.

826
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:18,880
What did you say?

827
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:20,920
Speak up!

828
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:22,160
Normally you're such a smooth talker.

829
00:36:22,160 --> 00:36:23,080
And now you're speechless.

830
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:24,840
Keep your voice down in public.

831
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,960
I'm in a bad mood and don't want to talk.

832
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:29,120
I'm annoyed as hell.

833
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,520
Come here.

834
00:37:18,680 --> 00:37:20,720
I can't believe this is happening.

835
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:23,240
I'm 48.

836
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:26,320
How is this even happening to me?

837
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:28,320
Huilan.

838
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,280
I like you.

839
00:37:30,680 --> 00:37:31,680
What did you say?

840
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:34,120
I know it's a bit sudden,

841
00:37:34,120 --> 00:37:35,000
but I'm serious.

842
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:39,680
Are you playing some kind of prank on me?

843
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,920
You're playing an NPC, right?

844
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:44,040
Where's the hidden camera?

845
00:37:48,560 --> 00:37:49,640
Please give me a chance.

846
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:00,960
Were you wasted last night?

847
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,120
And you're still not sober?

848
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:04,920
I wasn't actually drunk last night.

849
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:06,120
Well...

850
00:38:11,920 --> 00:38:13,400
I'm...

851
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:14,280
older than you...

852
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:15,400
by almost ten years.

853
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:16,080
Let me tell you,

854
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:17,120
the hair on this side...

855
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:18,960
all the hair on this side is white.

856
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:20,520
My hair on this side is white too.

857
00:38:20,520 --> 00:38:21,360
I dyed it.

858
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:28,000
Huilan...

859
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:32,440
This is the first time in my life I've fallen in love.

860
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:34,080
Is that really so wrong?

861
00:38:40,200 --> 00:38:40,920
No...

862
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:43,240
I mean...

863
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,920
Falling in love with someone isn't wrong.

864
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,160
But loving me...

865
00:38:48,160 --> 00:38:49,480
is a mistake.

866
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:52,480
Huilan.

867
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,320
I want to date you...

868
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:00,240
with marriage in mind.

869
00:39:01,120 --> 00:39:03,320
I never thought about marrying you.

870
00:39:03,320 --> 00:39:04,040
No.

871
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:06,000
I never thought about...

872
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,040
dating you.

873
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:09,680
That's not it either.

874
00:39:09,680 --> 00:39:10,400
It's just...

875
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,520
I should probably go.

876
00:39:12,520 --> 00:39:13,800
Huilan, I know.

877
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:14,400
It's a bit...

878
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:15,280
It's a bit too fast, isn't it?

879
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:16,240
It is too fast.

880
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:17,320
We can take it slow.

881
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:17,960
No, no, no.

882
00:39:18,080 --> 00:39:18,960
How about this?

883
00:39:19,120 --> 00:39:20,120
Let's go on a date first.

884
00:39:20,120 --> 00:39:21,320
Grab... grab something to eat.

885
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,400
Then go for a stroll.

886
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:23,760
And get some fresh air.

887
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:24,960
It'll be really nice.

888
00:39:27,600 --> 00:39:29,160
What crazy talk is this so early in the morning?

889
00:39:29,880 --> 00:39:30,880
Be a bit more mature.

890
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:32,480
You're a grown adult.

891
00:39:34,720 --> 00:39:36,400
This is truly ridiculous.

892
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,480
Lao Li, don't worry.

893
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:49,520
There is absolutely nothing going on between us.

894
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,120
Here.

895
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:52,400
Let me toast you.

896
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:57,120
Drink to happy occasions every day,

897
00:39:57,120 --> 00:39:58,720
and good things will come your way.

898
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:02,760
I promise.

899
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:06,320
Don't blame me for this.

900
00:40:06,960 --> 00:40:10,000
Maybe I'm just too pretty.

901
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:16,800
Oh, Lao Li.

902
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:04,520
One wrong step ruins a lifetime.

903
00:41:04,520 --> 00:41:09,080
Becoming a dancer just to survive.

904
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:11,680
A dancer is human too.

905
00:41:11,680 --> 00:41:14,560
Who can I share my inner pain with?

906
00:41:15,120 --> 00:41:17,160
Who can I share it with?

907
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:18,080
I'll share...

908
00:41:21,680 --> 00:41:22,600
What are you doing?

909
00:41:22,680 --> 00:41:24,240
I was just getting into the groove!

910
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:27,800
I was afraid you'd get locked up again for the noise.

911
00:41:28,080 --> 00:41:28,800
Bite your tongue!

912
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:30,240
Locked up for what?

913
00:41:30,240 --> 00:41:31,280
I just got out not long ago.

914
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,200
I'm in a good mood today,

915
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:35,280
so I won't hold it against you.

916
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,440
Come, sit down.

917
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:38,320
I said, sit down.

918
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:40,080
I have something to tell you.

919
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,160
What's the standard for a good job?

920
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:45,440
A legit company.

921
00:41:45,680 --> 00:41:46,440
Full benefits.

922
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:48,400
A good environment, little overtime.

923
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:50,000
Clear paths for promotion.

924
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,400
And opportunities for raises.

925
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:54,680
You're rambling on and on.

926
00:41:54,920 --> 00:41:56,280
Doesn't it boil down to this?

927
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:57,560
High pay.

928
00:41:57,560 --> 00:41:58,720
Less work.

929
00:41:58,720 --> 00:41:59,600
Close to home.

930
00:41:59,720 --> 00:42:00,520
Right?

931
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:04,800
Let me tell you,

932
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:07,120
I just found a job.

933
00:42:07,800 --> 00:42:09,080
Great environment,

934
00:42:09,160 --> 00:42:10,280
super stable,

935
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:12,120
and very respectable.

936
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:13,280
Quit your bragging.

937
00:42:13,560 --> 00:42:14,480
Me, bragging?

938
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:18,200
Open your dog eyes and take a good look.

939
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,240
What?

940
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:23,960
Angel Baby?

941
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:26,320
You are my baby.

942
00:42:26,760 --> 00:42:28,680
I am Angel Baby.

943
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:32,400
Call me Lanlan.
